# CelesteNet tickets are NOT server tickets
The Celestenet team is responsible for CelesteNet, a multiplayer mod to play Celeste with your friends. They are not server moderators. If you want to open a ticket to speak privately with the server's moderator team, use <#962025876407590912>.

If you would like to talk to the CelesteNet team, click the :envelope_with_arrow: Create Ticket button on the message above to open a temporary, private channel.

This can be used to report CelesteNet users, appeal celestenet bans, or any other reason you may need to contact the CelesteNet team.

As tickets are temporary, and will be deleted afterwards, if you would like a transcript of the conversation feel free to ask a member of the CelesteNet team at any time and it will be provided to you.
